WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.669
I just thought we could have a little fun.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:05.130
-Hmm.
-I'll bet...

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:09.592
ten TVs from our company.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:13.596
-Ten TVs!
-That sounds great!

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:17.559
To be honest,
I've been wanting to get a Penasonic TV.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.687
Has he been waiting for this opportunity?

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.399
Okay, Mr. Yamashita.

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:27.610
Then, what are you
prepared to bet in return?

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:30.613
Let me see...

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:36.286
If I lose, I'll give you the equivalent
to what the TVs are worth.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:40.749
-What do you say?
-That's fine. It's a bet.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.420
I proposed the bet to see
the caliber of the man.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.423
I didn't expect him
to accept it so easily.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:53.136
-That was very stupid.
-It's not a problem.

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:57.640
It's only ten TVs. It's peanuts
compared to what I already owe.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.478
He was using
Kengan Association code words.

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:04.481
When someone offers
a product from "our company",

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:06.232
they mean shares in that company.

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:07.817
Shares?

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:13.323
And the number means the percentage.
Which means...

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:18.244
you've just accepted a high stakes gamble
betting ten percent of Penasonic's shares.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:20.455
What? No!

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:25.085
Penasonic Corporation is
the biggest electronics company in Japan,

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.462
and he's betting
ten percent of their shares?

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:31.841
By the way, based on Penasonic
Corporation's current stock price,

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.095
the amount you'd pay
if you lose is about...

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:37.680
Two hundred and eighty billion yen.

